<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 02-MAY.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 02-MAY.</headline>
<text>
<p>The flood crest on the Red River is reaching Winnepeg, Manitoba, in Canada at this time. Flooding will be severe during the next 24-48 hours. The weather should be mostly dry during the next few days in that region as well as in the upper Plains of the USA where cleanup is now underway as waters recede.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
